public/terrain/gale-mola.json
----------------------------
  A 415 km window of elevation around Bradbury Landing, derived from:

    Mars Global Surveyor MOLA Mission Experiment Gridded Data Record
    MGS-M-MOLA-5-MEGDR-L3-V1.0, tile MEGT00N090HB
    Smith, D. E. et al., NASA Planetary Data System, Geosciences Node

  A work of the United States Government, not subject to copyright.
  Regenerate with tools/extract_mola.py — see docs/DATA.md.


public/terrain/msl-traverse.json
--------------------------------
  Curiosity's localised positions, sol 3 to sol 4977, derived from:

    MSL_waypoints.json, NASA/JPL-Caltech MMGIS
    https://mars.nasa.gov/mmgis-maps/MSL/Layers/json/MSL_waypoints.json

  Credit: NASA/JPL-Caltech.
  Regenerate with tools/extract_traverse.py.


