Reference imagery used during development
-----------------------------------------
  The terrain's colour palette was measured from PIA25175 (NASA/JPL-Caltech/MSSS),
  a Curiosity Mastcam frame of Gale Crater. That image is not redistributed here;
  only the four albedo constants derived from it appear in the source.


Branding
--------
  The "Office of Planetary Locomotion" is invented for this project: a fictional
  agency, its insignia, its division and its mission designation. It is an
  original mark, drawn in lib/insignia.ts, and it borrows the visual grammar of
  mid-century agency badges without reproducing any real agency's name, seal,
  wordmark or insignia.

  This project is an unofficial fan work. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
  by, or connected to NASA, JPL, Caltech or any government agency.
